note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Test-only observation controls, not production replacements.
note Both preserve equality validity but disclose secret-dependent stopping positions.
note Native functional success is REQUIRED, not evidence of observation equivalence.
note Scan exact raw functions with the pinned PR752 scanner; never scan ELF as raw.
note s contents and p/sn are public, h contents secret, only final validity disclosed.
fn ssfirstbyte s view uchar 65536 p ulong h view uchar 32 to ulong
for k ulong 32
if ne get h k get s add p k
ret 0
end
end
ret 1
end
fn ssfirstlist s view uchar 65536 sn ulong h view uchar 32 to ulong
t = new ulong 131074 0
z = cbrdec s sn t
r = cbrmfind t 0 2
j = add r 1
for i ulong cbrval t r
if eq cbrval t j 32
if ne dseqhash s cbrpoff t j h 0
ret 1
end
end
j = cbrnext t j
end
ret 0
end
